<!-- SECTION 1 -->
<h2>1. Building, Compilation &amp; Packaging Guide</h2>

<p>
  This guide provides step-by-step instructions for installing dependencies, running the application in local development mode, compiling for production, and containerizing via Docker.
</p>

<h3>1.1 Prerequisites</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Node.js:</strong> v18.0.0 or higher (v20+ LTS recommended).</li>
  <li><strong>npm:</strong> v9.0.0 or higher.</li>
  <li><strong>Port 3000:</strong> Ensure TCP Port 3000 is available on your host system.</li>
</ul>

<h3>1.2 Dependency Installation</h3>
<p>In the project root directory, run:</p>
<pre>npm install</pre>

<h3>1.3 Development Server Execution</h3>
<p>To run the Vite dev server with Hot Module Replacement (HMR) on port 3000:</p>
<pre>npm run dev</pre>
<p>Open your browser at: <strong>http://localhost:3000/</strong></p>

<h3>1.4 Production Build Compilation</h3>
<p>To build minified, optimized production assets:</p>
<pre>npm run build</pre>
<p>
  This executes <code>vite build</code> and generates production-ready bundles in the <code>/dist</code> folder:
</p>
<ul>
  <li><code>dist/index.html</code> — Production HTML entry point</li>
  <li><code>dist/assets/index-[hash].js</code> — Code-split, minified JavaScript bundle (~190 KB gzipped)</li>
  <li><code>dist/assets/index-[hash].css</code> — Minified design system stylesheet (~3.6 KB gzipped)</li>
  <li><code>dist/assets/scholarship_arj_form.pdf</code> — Printable offline application form</li>
</ul>

<h3>1.5 Running the Production Express Server</h3>
<p>To start the production server serving the compiled distribution:</p>
<pre>npm start</pre>
<p>Output confirmation:</p>
<pre>Disha Pariwar Portal v2.0 running at http://0.0.0.0:3000
Production SPA static assets mounted from /app/applet/dist</pre>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<!-- SECTION 2 -->
<h2>2. RESTful API Specification &amp; Expected Outputs</h2>

<p>
  All requests accept and return <code>application/json; charset=utf-8</code>.
</p>

<!-- ENDPOINT 1 -->
<h3>Endpoint 1: Track Application Status</h3>
<p><strong><code>GET /api/v1/applications/track?referenceNumber={ref}&amp;mobile={mobile}</code></strong></p>
<p>Allows applicants and parents to inspect real-time progress using their Reference Number and mobile digits.</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 25%;">Parameter</th>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Type</th>
      <th style="width: 15%;">Required</th>
      <th style="width: 45%;">Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>referenceNumber</code></td>
      <td>String</td>
      <td><span class="badge badge-danger">Yes</span></td>
      <td>Format: <code>DP-2026-XXXX</code> (Case-insensitive)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>mobile</code></td>
      <td>String</td>
      <td>Optional</td>
      <td>Last 4 or 10 digits of registered mobile number</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p><strong>Expected Output (Success 200 OK):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "referenceNumber": "DP-2026-8492",
    "studentName": "अनिकेत ज्ञानेश्वर पाटील (Aniket Dnyaneshwar Patil)",
    "mobile": "9876543210",
    "email": "aniket.patil@example.com",
    "district": "सातारा (Satara)",
    "course": "B.Tech Computer Engineering (1st Year)",
    "collegeName": "Government College of Engineering, Karad",
    "familyIncome": 65000,
    "marks10th": 88.40,
    "marks12th": 82.60,
    "status": "UNDER_REVIEW",
    "statusMr": "छाननी चालू आहे",
    "statusEn": "Under Committee Review",
    "appliedAt": "2026-08-12",
    "assignedReviewer": "S. K. Joshi",
    "remarks": "सर्व कागदपत्रे प्राप्त झाली आहेत. समितीची बैठक लवकरच होईल."
  }
}</pre>

<p><strong>Expected Output (Not Found 404):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Application not found with given details."
}</pre>

<!-- ENDPOINT 2 -->
<h3>Endpoint 2: Submit New Scholarship Application</h3>
<p><strong><code>POST /api/v1/applications</code></strong></p>
<p>Submits a 3-step application dossier for review. Automatically assigns a unique tracking reference number.</p>

<p><strong>Request Payload:</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "studentName": "सुमित विठ्ठल जाधव (Sumit Vitthal Jadhav)",
  "mobile": "9822114455",
  "email": "sumit.jadhav@example.com",
  "district": "सातारा (Satara)",
  "tehsil": "कराड (Karad)",
  "address": "मु. पो. तांबवे, ता. कराड, जि. सातारा",
  "aadhaarNumber": "458912345678",
  "course": "B.Sc Computer Science",
  "collegeName": "Kisan Veer Mahavidyalaya, Wai",
  "educationType": "DEGREE",
  "marks10th": 87.60,
  "marks12th": 84.20,
  "familyIncome": 55000,
  "parentOccupation": "अल्पभूधारक शेतकरी (Small Farmer)",
  "bankName": "Bank of Maharashtra",
  "accountNumber": "60234567890",
  "ifscCode": "MAHB0000123"
}</pre>

<p><strong>Expected Output (Success 201 Created / 200 OK):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "referenceNumber": "DP-2026-4821",
  "data": {
    "referenceNumber": "DP-2026-4821",
    "studentName": "सुमित विठ्ठल जाधव (Sumit Vitthal Jadhav)",
    "mobile": "9822114455",
    "appliedAt": "2026-09-25",
    "status": "UNDER_REVIEW",
    "statusMr": "अर्ज प्राप्त झाला / छाननी प्रलंबित",
    "statusEn": "Received &amp; Pending Verification",
    "remarks": "तुमचा अर्ज यशस्वीरीत्या जमा झाला आहे."
  }
}</pre>

<!-- ENDPOINT 3 -->
<h3>Endpoint 3: Admin List &amp; Filter Applications</h3>
<p><strong><code>GET /api/v1/admin/applications</code></strong></p>
<p>Retrieves all applications for review committee members with status, district, and text filtering.</p>

<p><strong>Expected Output (Success 200 OK):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "referenceNumber": "DP-2026-8492",
      "studentName": "अनिकेत ज्ञानेश्वर पाटील",
      "mobile": "9876543210",
      "district": "सातारा",
      "course": "B.Tech Computer Engineering",
      "familyIncome": 65000,
      "marks10th": 88.40,
      "status": "UNDER_REVIEW",
      "appliedAt": "2026-08-12"
    },
    {
      "referenceNumber": "DP-2026-7215",
      "studentName": "प्रियांका राहुल साळुंखे",
      "mobile": "9123456780",
      "district": "सोलापूर",
      "course": "Diploma in Electrical Engineering",
      "familyIncome": 48000,
      "marks10th": 91.20,
      "status": "APPROVED",
      "appliedAt": "2026-07-28"
    }
  ]
}</pre>

<!-- ENDPOINT 4 -->
<h3>Endpoint 4: Admin Update Application Status</h3>
<p><strong><code>PUT /api/v1/admin/applications/{referenceNumber}/status</code></strong></p>
<p>Updates an applicant's evaluation status, sanctioned scholarship amount, and official remarks.</p>

<p><strong>Request Payload:</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "sanctionAmount": 20000,
  "remarks": "समितीने अर्ज मंजूर केला आहे. शिष्यवृत्ती वाटप लवकरच होईल."
}</pre>

<p><strong>Expected Output (Success 200 OK):</strong></p>
<pre>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "referenceNumber": "DP-2026-8492",
    "status": "APPROVED",
    "statusMr": "मंजूर करण्यात आला",
    "statusEn": "Scholarship Approved",
    "sanctionAmount": 20000,
    "remarks": "समितीने अर्ज मंजूर केला आहे. शिष्यवृत्ती वाटप लवकरच होईल."
  }
}</pre>

