<h2>4. Ready-to-Run cURL Test Commands</h2>

<h3>Test 1: Track Existing Application</h3>
<pre>curl -X GET "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/applications/track?referenceNumber=DP-2026-8492&amp;mobile=9876543210" \
     -H "Accept: application/json"</pre>

<h3>Test 2: Submit New Application</h3>
<pre>curl -X POST "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/applications" \
     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
     -d '{
       "studentName": "अमृता पांडुरंग शिंदे",
       "mobile": "9765432109",
       "district": "पुणे",
       "course": "B.Com",
       "familyIncome": 72000,
       "marks10th": 89.20
     }'</pre>

<h3>Test 3: Admin Status Promotion</h3>
<pre>curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin/applications/DP-2026-8492/status" \
     -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
     -d '{
       "status": "APPROVED",
       "remarks": "समितीने अर्ज मंजूर केला आहे."
     }'</pre>

